---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6">
    <header class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted">Last updated: November 16, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-4 rounded-2xl bg-card p-9 shadow-[var(--shadow-border)] sm:p-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">What we collect</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        Base Impact Inc. collects information you voluntarily provide through our contact,
        feedback, volunteer, and story forms, and through emails, texts, and phone calls to
        us — typically your name, email address, phone number, and the message or material you
        send. We do not maintain a separate customer database or CRM.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">How we use it</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        We use your information to respond to you and to carry out our mission. As described
        below, material you send us may also become part of the content and record of our work.
        We do not sell your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Submissions you send us</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        When you send us a story, comment, email, photograph, image, video, request, or any
        other material — by phone, text, email, or a form on this website — you give Base Impact
        permission to use it. We may use it as content on this site and in our communications,
        as proof or documentation of needs we have seen, as ideas and notes for our work, and to
        describe the services we provide or help with.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted">
        In particular, we may turn what you send us into a story or blog post: we can write
        about the requests you send us and how we helped, the events, people, and situations
        you tell us about, and publish any photos, images, messages, or emails you send
        alongside them. Your messages, photos, emails, and requests may become the basis for
        the stories we tell about our work, with names or identifying details changed when
        we think it is appropriate to protect privacy.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted">
        This permission is broad: it includes the right to keep, copy, edit, shorten, reformat,
        publish, display, and share the material, in whole or in part, in any medium, for as
        long as we need it, without payment to you. It applies to stories, comments, emails,
        pictures, requests, and anything else you send to our phone numbers, email addresses,
        or website forms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Data storage</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        Form submissions and messages are sent to our email inbox. We keep them as long as
        needed to respond, provide services, or document our work, and then review them
        periodically.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Third-party services</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        This site uses Cloudflare for hosting and security and loads Cloudflare Web Analytics
        for aggregate traffic statistics. Those services may collect standard server logs (IP
        address, browser type, timestamps) as part of their normal operations. We do not
        control their data practices.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Children's privacy</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13. If you believe a child
        has provided us with personal information, contact us and we will remove it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Changes</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        We may update this policy as our organization grows. Changes will be posted on this
        page with an updated date.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">
        Questions about this policy: <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Contact Base Impact</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="text-xs text-muted">
      Base Impact Inc. is a Florida nonprofit corporation. This site does not collect
      payment information. We do not accept donations.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
